<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica's Afribrand list 104.4 mln shares Tuesday.</title>
<headline>SAfrica's Afribrand list 104.4 mln shares Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Afribrand Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it would list some 104.4 million shares of one cent each on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company would be listed under the abbreviated name Afbrand on the Industrial -- &quot;Food&quot; sector.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
<p>E-mail, johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
